            ✓ <strong>Flexible Publishing:</strong> You can publish a downloadable <code>.exe</code> bundle, an external <strong>Website Redirect URL</strong>, or both together!
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-2 flex justify-end gap-3">
          <button type="button" onclick="closeUploadModal()" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm bg-[#22113d] hover:bg-purple-900/70 text-purple-200">
